          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Run eta at W = 2.0, Q2 = 3.0 with a 2.2 GeV beam.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_08c1cfb790016INbXZZ1o5kr5R",
          "sessionID": "ses_f73e3049effecCaqh6rq0haZ2W",
          "messageID": "msg_08c1cfb76001Y0cO3L4SPlZ16k"
