        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This is physically impossible: at W=2.0, Q\u00b2=3.0 the energy transfer \u03bd=W\u00b2+Q\u00b2-Mp\u00b2 over (2Mp) \u2248 3.26 GeV exceeds the 2.2 GeV beam, so \u03bd>E_beam \u2014 no real photon can be exchanged. I'll record this in the outcome.",
